agua Valley","myRating":2,"ratedDate":"4/18/26","pickedForYou":null,"communityAvg":3.7,"communityCount":111,"critics":[{"score":91,"source":"JamesSuckling"},{"score":91,"source":"WilfredWong"},{"score":90,"source":"WineSpectator"}],"priceUsd":21.97,"attrs":[],"sommName":"Josefina","sommWriteup":"This carmenere is violets, pine and berries, with lots of earthy texture, think of it like a South American Bordeaux. Enjoy it with grilled food or when you want something as rich as a cab, but a little more elegant.","path":"/product/los-vascos-cromas-gran-reserva-carmenere-2020/1007344"},{"id":"2440399","sku":"SKRUSBDV0923_2023","name":"Bonny Doon Le Cigare Volant 2023","vintage":2023,"varietal":"Rhone Blends","origin":"Monterey, Central Coast, California","country":"California","region":"Monterey","myRating":null,"ratedDate":null,"pickedForYou":"4/4/26","communityAvg":3.8,"communityCount":11,"critics":[],"priceUsd":18.97,"attrs":["Screw Cap"],"sommName":null,"sommWriteup":null,"path":"/product/bonny-doon-le-cigare-volant-2023/2440399"},{"id":"3168169","sku":"TON13808_21_2021","name":"Luke The Companion Red Blend 2021","vintage":2021,"varietal":"Other Red Blends","origin":"Columbia Valley, Washington","country":"Washington","region":"Columbia Valley","myRating":null,"ratedDate":null,"pickedForYou":"4/4/26","communityAvg":4.5,"communityCount":48,"critics":[{"score":92,"source":"JamesSuckling"},{"score":92,"source":"WilfredWong"},{"score":90,"source":"WineEnthusiast"},{"score":90,"source":"WineSpectator"}],"priceUsd":null,"attrs":[],"sommName":"Aimee","sommWriteup":"The Wahluke Slope in Washington's Columbia Valley faces South for maximum sun exposure, allowing Rhone & Bordeaux varietals to perfectly ripen while cool nights preserve the diurnal shifts to preserve acidity & complexity. Rich and fruit-forward.","path":"/product/luke-the-companion-red-blend-2021/3168169"},{"id":"2049627","sku":"TON99206_21_2021","name":"Sur de los Andes Reserva Cabernet Franc 2021","vintage":2021,"varietal":"Cabernet Franc","origin":"Mendoza, Argentina","country":"Argentina","region":"Mendoza","myRating":null,"ratedDate":null,"pickedForYou":"3/5/26","communityAvg":4.2,"communityCount":99,"critics":[{"score":92,"source":"WilfredWong"},{"score":91,"source":"JamesSuckling"}],"priceUsd":null,"attrs":[],"sommName":null,"sommWriteup":null,"path":"/product/sur-de-los-andes-reserva-cabernet-franc-2021/2049627"},{"id":"1671428","sku":"PIN601875_2021","name":"CARO Amancaya 2021","vintage":2021,"varietal":"Bordeaux Red Blends","origin":"Mendoza, Argentina","country":"Argentina","region":"Mendoza","myRating":null,"ratedDate":null,"pickedForYou":"3/5/26","communityAvg":3.7,"communityCount":43,"critics":[{"score":93,"source":"JamesSuckling"}],"priceUsd":25.97,"attrs":[],"sommName":"Josefina","sommWriteup":"A mouth-coating red that you can sip on all night long. In this Argentinian take on a Bordeaux blend, the Malbec gives it a fleshy spicy blueberry side and the cabernet gives it some depth and spice.","path":"/product/caro-amancaya-2021/1671428"},{"id":"1252169","sku":"OPI110363_2020","name":"Famille Perrin Vinsobres Les Cornuds 2020","vintage":2020,"varietal":"Rhone Blends","origin":"Vinsobres, Rhone, France","country":"France","region":"Vinsobres","myRating":null,"ratedDate":null,"pickedForYou":"3/5/26","communityAvg":3.6,"communityCount":24,"critics":[{"score":90,"source":"WineSpectator"}],"priceUsd":null,"attrs":[],"sommName":"Josefina","sommWriteup":"A blend of Grenache and Syrah from Southern Rhone. Black fruit, licorice with fennel notes. I paired this wine with olive tapenade and a cheese board. Although I also love this wine by the glass!","path":"/product/famille-perrin-vinsobres-les-cornuds-2020/1252169"},{"id":"3674397","sku":"PIN644329_2021","name":"Haras de Pirque Hussonet Gran Reserva Cabernet Sauvignon 2021","vintage":2021,"varietal":"Cabernet Sauvignon","origin":"Maipo Valley, Chile","country":"Chile","region":"Maipo Valley","myRating":null,"ratedDat