,"attrs":["Green"],"sommName":"Josefina","sommWriteup":"This is a fun pinot noir expression, since they do a whole cluster fermentation. As a result, carbonic maceration happens, which provides a lighter, fruitier version of pinot. Pair it with any style of fish.","path":"/product/willamette-valley-vineyards-whole-cluster-pinot-noir-2023/2323723"},{"id":"3221557","sku":"PIN651731_2023","name":"Pertinace Dolcetto d'Alba 2023","vintage":2023,"varietal":"Dolcetto","origin":"Piedmont, Italy","country":"Italy","region":"Piedmont","myRating":null,"ratedDate":null,"pickedForYou":"1/5/26","communityAvg":null,"communityCount":null,"critics":[],"priceUsd":null,"attrs":[],"sommName":null,"sommWriteup":null,"path":"/product/pertinace-dolcetto-dalba-2023/3221557"},{"id":"2794032","sku":"TON83468_18_2018","name":"La Lecciaia Sassarello 2018","vintage":2018,"varietal":"Other Red Blends","origin":"Tuscany, Italy","country":"Italy","region":"Tuscany","myRating":5,"ratedDate":"12/14/25","pickedForYou":null,"communityAvg":4.3,"communityCount":80,"critics":[{"score":92,"source":"JamesSuckling"}],"priceUsd":19.97,"attrs":[],"sommName":"Josefina","sommWriteup":"A great value Super Tuscan, a blend of Sangiovese with some Merlot and Cabernet Sauvignon. The grapes are sourced from the prestigious Brunello area. This wine is aged for a year in oak and 6 months in bottle. I like it with aged cheeses.","path":"/product/la-lecciaia-sassarello-2018/2794032"},{"id":"2411394","sku":"TON97330_23_2023","name":"Emilio Moro Finca Resalso 2023","vintage":2023,"varietal":"Tempranillo","origin":"Ribera del Duero, Spain","country":"Spain","region":"Ribera del Duero","myRating":null,"ratedDate":null,"pickedForYou":"12/6/25","communityAvg":4.5,"communityCount":58,"critics":[{"score":90,"source":"JamesSuckling"},{"score":90,"source":"WineEnthusiast"}],"priceUsd":null,"attrs":[],"sommName":"Josefina","sommWriteup":"The vines for this wine were planted in 1932 when the founder Emilio Moro was born. This is their fresher style Tempranillo, easy to drink with some tapas or just by the glass.","path":"/product/emilio-moro-finca-resalso-2023/2411394"},{"id":"2483033","sku":"BRFBAF106688_22_2022","name":"Domaine Pierre Usseglio et Fils L'Unique Rouge 2022","vintage":2022,"varietal":"Rhone Blends","origin":"Rhone, France","country":"France","region":"Rhone","myRating":null,"ratedDate":null,"pickedForYou":"12/6/25","communityAvg":null,"communityCount":null,"critics":[{"score":91,"source":"JebDunnuck"}],"priceUsd":22.99,"attrs":[],"sommName":null,"sommWriteup":null,"path":"/product/domaine-pierre-usseglio-et-fils-lunique-rouge-2022/2483033"},{"id":"3781349","sku":"WBO30333941_2023","name":"Bodega Garzon Uruguay Reserva Tannat 2023","vintage":2023,"varietal":"Tannat","origin":"Uruguay","country":"Uruguay","region":null,"myRating":null,"ratedDate":null,"pickedForYou":"12/6/25","communityAvg":3.5,"communityCount":13,"critics":[{"score":91,"source":"JamesSuckling"},{"score":91,"source":"WineEnthusiast"},{"score":91,"source":"WineSpectator"},{"score":90,"source":"JebDunnuck"},{"score":90,"source":"Vinous"}],"priceUsd":null,"attrs":[],"sommName":"Josefina","sommWriteup":"Tannat is considered Uruguay's noble variety, although native to the south of France. It makes decidedly robust wines, with pronounced aromas of smoke and plum, significant tannins and a spicy finish. Works great with a hearty mushroom stew.","path":"/product/bodega-garzon-uruguay-reserva-tannat-2023/3781349"},{"id":"3456504","sku":"WBO30335350_2024","name":"G.D. Vajra Langhe Nebbiolo 2024","vintage":2024,"varietal":"Nebbiolo","origin":"Langhe, Piedmont, Italy","country":"Italy","region":"Langhe","myRating":null,"ratedDate":null,"pickedForYou":"12/6/25","communityAvg":3.8,"communityCount":14,"critics":[{"score":90,"source":"JebDunnuck"},{"score":90,"source":"WineSpectator"}],"priceUsd":null,"attrs":[],"sommName":null,"sommWriteup":null,"path":"/product/gd-vajra-langhe-nebbiolo-2024/3456504"},{"id":"3530525","sku":"SKR